  contentType: 2
  messageText: 'Welcome, Pioneer!


    Survival is key. Gather vital resources,
    monitor your health, energy, stamina, and oxygen stats, and earn Aether Credits
    along your journey.


    [WASD] Move  |  [E] Use  |  [I] Inventory

    [Tab]
    Switch weapon  |  [RMB] Block  |  [LMB] Attack


    Press START GAME when you
    are ready.'
